{"data":{"body":"**P2:** Repeated immediate READY responses keep this user worker occupied indefinitely. With the handler and this operation occupying a two-thread executor, a sibling `stepAsync` remains queued; if that step is what makes the condition true, the execution hangs. Retain the activity lease but finish the current handler before resubmitting the next attempt through the coordinator, and add a bounded-executor test where a sibling operation unlocks the condition.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77N-fU","finding_digest":"e1b76262e02b48df3e01138af318535b2a2a1cf5d715b2d4012bb3ee7dfe182a","finding_id":"arf_v1_4g3weyxafnen6pqbcofpggctlm","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::runcheckloop::immediate-ready-worker-starvation","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::runcheckloop::immediate-ready-worker-starvation","line":184,"observation_digest":"f06aede2e4cabb70c7f94f49657c70ff48fc571a1c79ef111dae16163e619759","observation_id":"aro_v1_6bvo3yxezk5xbr7zj5ewk7dq75","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/WaitForConditionOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T04:38:45Z","review_id":"arr_v1_g22jnojmr2yjh5iswhd6ngdqso","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"361c25bdd0acc0c1e10edb8cb252fbd1b4865065","reviewer":"codex","start_line":180,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_hro3r7kbixxc27mirju2ilw7ov","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T04:38:45Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
